'''Herb patches''' are a type of [[Farming]] patch found in the [[Chambers of Xeric]] resource rooms.

[[Golpar (plant)|Golpar]], [[Buchu (plant)|Buchu]] and [[Noxifer (plant)|Noxifer]] plants can be grown in them.